	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11528"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=367" title="View the profile of Hemdall">Hemdall</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 2<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I'm a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=367"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=991.msg11528#msg11528"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=991.msg11528#msg11528">Re: Rodcet Nife Allstars</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #140 on:</b> October 01, 2004, 11:07:32 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Let me say that I never was in a group or raid with Vesi at all.&nbsp; I don&#039;t remember Vesi being in the alliance, AoD, EL or AL during the time I played.&nbsp; Vesi might have been an alt turned main for someone that I might have known.&nbsp; /shrug&nbsp; Of course I might not be very &quot;observant&quot; of Del&#039;s natural superiority and UBERishness.&nbsp; /bow<br /><br />An observant person would note that I didn&#039;t knock Reia&#039;s allstar status.&nbsp; Matter of fact I didn&#039;t mention him at all.&nbsp; I agree that Reia should be a member fo the shaman allstars.&nbsp; I merely mentioned Dwilgar as someone who was at the top of the Shaman game(Original EQ + Kunark + Velious) as well as being someone very vocal on the Shaman boards.&nbsp; I have followed the main Shaman boards since I started playing a Shaman and I know that Dwilgar posted many times on Shaman subjects.&nbsp; He was a strong advocate of Shaman &quot;things&quot;.&nbsp; That in my book warrants his inclusion to the RN allstars.<br /><br />I still think that Dyvim was not only a kick ass warrior(best IMO) but also one of the greatest personalities on RN.<br /><br />Hemdall
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
