							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=991.msg11528#msg11528">Quote from: Hemdall on October 01, 2004, 11:07:32 am</a></div><div class="quote">Let me say that I never was in a group or raid with Vesi at all.  I don&#039;t remember Vesi being in the alliance, AoD, EL or AL during the time I played.</div>He was from batmud where people such as myself, Glayde, Dwilgar, Reia, Moonshine, Klar and others came from. He was in Altered Destinyt until about third of the way through Velious iirc.<br /><br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">I still think that Dyvim was not only a kick ass warrior(best IMO) but also one of the greatest personalities on RN.</div>Well I didn&#039;t invite him to Ascent in WoW to just fill up the ranks. He tends to be the one getting multi-group action going on while I&#039;m not online. Now that I&#039;m mostly playing RTW that&#039;s most of the time.
						</td>
