							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Man I haven&#039;t been to these boards in forever but i have to post a list!<br /><br />Bard - Dameter( the old Dameter who was originally in aom kicked ass)<br />Beastlord - Tban<br />Cleric - Gershon/Reyem/Hamek all stand out as awesome clerics<br />Druid - Jhesair, Kozlik <br />Enchanter - Cyprian(also on povar with me), Arweyn<br />Mage - Skoalenemy, not many mages out there but this one was always on the balll<br />Monk - Brooce, Kareel, - old aom pulling crew who knew their shit without being told<br />Necro - Aussie, Shamllyn, Vorczar all owned, and Depraven(you&#039;re still a jackass~)<br />Paladin - Thebobo - hands down, best pally skillwise serverwide<br />Ranger - Kinladar, Corolinth , Mylos - These guys always stood out cuz they played rangers to a different level<br />Rogue - Weben, my main competition in aom, Xerno - played exactly like me( on povar but like quit), Shadobane- when he wasn&#039;t being a fag<br />Shaman - Ingtarr, Dissonant always were the best~<br />Shadowknight -&nbsp; Mdien<br />Warrior -&nbsp; Aarrokk, hands down best warrior i know, and now on povar with him=P Rakzum comes to mind from so many grinds and Kaidog when he wasnt&#039; fucking afk, and Whitephoenix for being fast but always dying so fast=P<br />Wizard - Callaaen, Djtar
