							From all the lists, its an ongoing tradition of only listing their own guildies.&nbsp; While its true because thats mainly who people group up with.&nbsp; I just find it funny that sysquella likes to suck ascents dick=P<br /><br />Oh and I still don&#039;t understand how people can even list Lower.&nbsp; Aside from him having good gear, he was the biggest retard rogue I knew.&nbsp; <br />He used to be in Wayfarer and I was in a smaller guild (Anarchy Incarnate) I was in, and he was always afk, and just didn&#039;t know how to play a rogue at all.&nbsp; He didn&#039;t have his Ragebringer til level 60 heh.&nbsp; 
